WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Crouching medium punch starts the conversion.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.900
Crouching heavy punch and heavy Stribog launch Ryu.

3
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.600
The forward dash covers the first part of the travel.

4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.250
Raw Rush closes the remaining distance for delayed forward heavy kick.

5
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.550
Light Triglav catches Ryu at the near placement.

6
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.650
Heavy Departure is placed after the near-spike knockdown.
